title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (socialist_dissent > 30 and not socialist_resign) or (humanist_dissent > 30 and not humanists_resign) or (liberal_dissent > 30 and not krf_formed) or (constitutionalist_dissent > 30 and not constitutionalist_independent) or (neoforsvollrist_dissent > 30 and not neoforsvollrist_split)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/kcp_disunity.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

# TODO: party dissent events for every faction, have a good image for this... 

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, the party wings have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if socialist_dissent > 30 : The socialists are in uproar over the direction of our party and are slowly filtering back to more left leaning parties.  ?]
[? if humanist_dissent > 30 : The humanists are dissenting over our course of action. ?]
[? if liberal_dissent > 30 : The liberals of all colours are grumbling about our course of action are considering their options. ?]
[? if constitutionalist_dissent > 30: The constitutionalists are questioning if this party even represents them anymore.  ?]
[? if neoforsvollrist_dissent > 30 : The Neoforsvollrists grumble at their exclusion from guiding the party. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_socialist
- @concessions_humanist
- @concessions_liberal
- @concessions_constitutionalist
- @concessions_neoforsvollrist
- @do_nothing


@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: socialist_dissent -= 5; humanist_dissent -= 5; liberal_dissent -= 5; constitutionalist_dissent -= 5; neoforsvollrist_dissent -= 5; workers_kcp -= 4; new_middle_kcp -= 2; unemployed_kcp -= 2

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_socialist
title: Give concessions to the socialists.
view-if: socialist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: socialist_dissent -= 7; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5

We have given concessions to the socialists. The right grumbles.

@concessions_humanist
title: Give concessions to the humanists
view-if: humanist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: humanist_dissent -= 7; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5

We have adopted more of a humanist stand to calm them down.

@concessions_liberal
title: Give concessions to liberals.
view-if: liberal_dissent > 30
on-arrival: liberal_dissent -= 7; socialist_dissent += 5

The liberals are given a larger voice in the party but the socialists are annoyed.

@concessions_constitutionalists
title: Give concessions to the neorevisionists.
view-if: neorevisionist_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism = 1
on-arrival: constitutional_dissent -= 7; humanist_dissent += 5; socialist_dissent += 5

Giving the constitutionalists more influence alienated the humanists and socialists

@concessions_neoforsvollrist
title: Calm down the Neoforsvollrists.
view-if: neorevisionist_dissent > 30 
on-arrival: neoforsvollrist_dissent -= 7; socialist_dissent += 5; humanist_dissent += 5; constitutionalist_dissent += 5 

Giving the neoforsvollrists more control of the party raises concerns over those more left than the constitutionalists.

@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: socialist_dissent += 1; humanist_dissent += 1; liberal_dissent += 1; constitutionalist_dissent += 1; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.

# TODO: should we be allowed to preemptively expel factions?

@expel_reformists
title: Expel the dissident reformists.
view-if: reformist_dissent > 30

@expel_left
title: Expel the dissident leftists.
view-if: left_dissent > 30

@expel_center
title: Expel the centrists.
view-if: center_dissent > 30

@expel_labor
title: Expel the labor supporters.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
